26:52.528 --> 26:54.113
This one plays Melody A.

26:54.196 --> 26:55.948
This one plays Melody B.

26:56.032 --> 26:58.826
Together, they go off
within 200 or 300 yards of each other,

26:58.909 --> 27:00.911
