28:09.730 --> 28:10.815
Yeah.

28:10.898 --> 28:12.441
Welcome to the world, Bob.

28:12.525 --> 28:14.110
Let's go! Big picture.

28:14.193 --> 28:15.611
Got it. Yeah.

28:16.529 --> 28:17.530
Okay.

28:18.614 --> 28:20.658
Okay. Okay.

28:24.036 --> 28:25.079
